text.section:
The Committee shall review and make recommendations as necessary to the Director of the Department and the Forensic Science Board concerning:

New scientific programs, protocols, and methods of testing;


Plans for the implementation of new programs, sustaining existing programs and improving upon them where possible, and the elimination of programs no longer needed;


Protocols for testing and examination methods, and guidelines for the presentation of results in court; and


Qualification standards for the various scientists of the Department, including the Director.
